{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relocat</strong> is a narrative 2D adventure about growing up, moving away, and trying to keep warmth alive amid uncertain times.<br>You play as a young cat preparing for the New Year in a cozy village \u2014 taking on gift orders, managing your happiness, hunger, and energy, improving your small home, and slowly building a new life where even the simplest tasks become steps toward adulthood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944590/extras/7aa83709cf16f3d1fe73d6227b39a914.poster.avif?t=1763643200\" width=780 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944590/extras/7aa83709cf16f3d1fe73d6227b39a914.webm?t=1763643200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944590/extras/7aa83709cf16f3d1fe73d6227b39a914.mp4?t=1763643200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn by making gifts.</strong> Find requested items and wrap them by hand \u2014 everyone expects exactly what they asked for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take care of yourself.</strong> Happiness, hunger, and energy affect your pace and the actions available to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose who to trust.</strong> Conversations and decisions shape your relationships with the villagers and open new story branches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settle in.</strong> Collected items appear in your room, turning small keepsakes into pieces of a personal story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944590?t=1763643200","background_raw":"https://s