 yourself.</strong> Happiness, hunger, and energy affect your pace and the actions available to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose who to trust.</strong> Conversations and decisions shape your relationships with the villagers and open new story branches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settle in.</strong> Collected items appear in your room, turning small keepsakes into pieces of a personal story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ahhTrevor"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944590/197f204f642ac963c7484251086474be2555cc32/header.jpg?t=1763643200","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus / Apple M1 GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3944590/355112621/cedaedd79f9c9123051080861462ded9d8be6765/1759574591/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759574967","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3944590/355112621/cedaedd79f9c9123051080861462ded9d8be6765/1759574591/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759574967","highli